    "The expanded corpus still exposes weak or repair-sensitive families: fixed_table_qa is 23/35, numeric_tolerance is 24/35 with two format-only failures, rewrite_normalized fell from 90% to 75%, required_forbidden_tokens is 22/30, and synthetic_extraction is 19/25.",
    "Reference-vs-Rust comparison remains incomplete for expansion decisions: the 100-case comparison had 54/100 text matches and 83/100 mechanical scoring matches, while no 250-case reference-runner comparison was published.",
    "Because the next target is trustworthy, benchmarkable inference rather than raw corpus size, the honest next step is a repair-focused 250-case refresh before paying for a 500-case BitNet runtime campaign."
  ],
